Yeah. Cubby, I can fight.


00:39:46.151 --> 00:39:47.685
I can be somebody.


00:39:47.686 --> 00:39:51.422
Go be somebody with somebody
else, and let me be. Huh?


00:39:51.423 --> 00:39:53.102
You know I can fight.


00:39:53.425 --> 00:39:56.037
I don't know if you have
the heart or the head.


00:39:57.028 --> 00:39:59.296
Just give me a shot.


00:39:59.297 --> 00:40:01.272
You had your shot!


00:40:02.334 --> 00:40:04.639
You know what you did before, huh?


00:40:09.007 --> 00:40:12.410
I'm sorry about before.
I know I disappointed you.


00:40:12.411 --> 00:40:15.888
- I... I didn't know better.
- You got that right.


00:40:17.182 --> 00:40:19.384
Can you please just give me
another chance?


00:40:20.652 --> 00:40:22.160
Hey!


00:40:23.021 --> 00:40:26.157
You watch your stance, huh?
You gotta put your left...


00:40:26.158 --> 00:40:28.392
I told you not to be so wide, huh?


00:40:28.393 --> 00:40:30.461
Close up your stance,
and you keep your left


00:40:30.462 --> 00:40:32.232
in his face, huh?


00:40:33.365 --> 00:40:34.600
Hey, kid!


00:40:35.133 --> 00:40:36.869
King!


00:40:46.845 --> 00:40:49.685
You are not going to flake out
on me this time, are you?


00:40:50.115 --> 00:40:51.555
Hm?


00:40:51.716 --> 00:40:55.659
- No.
- Are you gonna stick to it? Train?


00:40:56.221 --> 00:40:57.855
Come to the gym on time?


00:40:57.856 --> 00:41:00.391
Yeah, I promise. You know...
You know I got talent.


00:41:00.392 --> 00:41:03.095
Yeah, but are you willing
to put in the hard yards?


00:41:05.230 --> 00:41:08.132
Give me a fight, you'll see.


00:41:08.133 --> 00:41:09.744
Hey.


00:41:11.069 --> 00:41:14.341
If you fail me this time...
Hey, look at me.


00:41:15.507 --> 00:41:18.075
If you fail me this
time, it's over.


00:41:18.076 --> 00:41:20.222
Huh? You got it?


00:41:21.079 --> 00:41:23.520
- I got it.
- All right.


00:41:24.316 --> 00:41:29.431
Now, this is against my better
judgment, but I will give you a fight.


00:41:30.889 --> 00:41:32.363
All right?


00:41:37.262 --> 00:41:38.696
Thanks, Cubby.


00:41:38.697 --> 00:41:40.564
It won't be much.


00:41:40.565 --> 00:41:42.870
That's okay, I just...


00:41:43.935 --> 00:41:47.207
I just need something
to get me going again.


00:41:49.574 --> 00:41:51.651
Let's go, box!


00:41:54.412 --> 00:41:56.148
Use your jab!


00:42:05.557 --> 00:42:07.758
Get those hands low,
Sailor, let's go.


00:42:07.759 --> 00:42:09.131
Break it up!


00:42:09.794 --> 00:42:12.329
Take the old man out, King!


00:42:12.330 --> 00:42:14.271
Put him in the hospital, King!


00:42:23.041 --> 00:42:27.177
Head butt, really? That's how you gonna
fight? Huh? Huh? You ain't know how to box!


00:42:27.178 --> 00:42:30.214
- You're a boxer, let's go.
- This is dirty boxing.


00:42:30.215 --> 00:42:33.419
- Get to your corners.
- I apologize.


00:42:34.586 --> 00:42:37.054
Let me see your head.
Let me see your head!


00:42:37.055 --> 00:42:39.223
All right. All right.


00:42:39.224 --> 00:42:41.292
You know Sailor's got
a fight coming up.


00:42:41.293 --> 00:42:43.473
Yeah, yeah, I know.


00:42:44.996 --> 00:42:46.530
He can't do it.


00:42:46.531 --> 00:42:51.302
No. But I'll bet you're gonna
be in his corner though, right?


00:42:51.303 --> 00:42:53.237
What am I gonna do? It's Sailor.


00:42:53.238 --> 00:42:56.317
"What am I gonna do?" I mean,
you could try talking to him.


00:42:57.075 --> 00:42:59.778
- Did you?
- Yes, I did.


00:43:01.379 --> 00:43:03.525
You know what this is all about.


00:43:04.649 --> 00:43:06.851
Well, I don't know.
He told me he missed it.


00:43:07.052 --> 00:43:11.355
Yeah, well, that's all well and
good, but it's his mother.


00:43:11.356 --> 00:43:13.126
His mom's dying.


00:43:14.459 --> 00:43:16.138
Huh.


00:43:17.796 --> 00:43:19.873
That's kind of
inconvenient for her.


00:43:20.665 --> 00:43:25.102
Rose wants to visit the old
country again before she passes.


00:43:25.103 --> 00:43:28.750
He gets 4 grand, even if he loses.


00:43:29.174 --> 00:43:32.409
Yeah, but, I mean, you and I could
put up that money for him, and...


00:43:32.410 --> 00:43:34.749
- He wouldn't take it.
- You tried already?


00:43:34.779 --> 00:43:35.980
I offered him money.


00:43:35.981 --> 00:43:39.216
I said, "All you gotta do, come by
the shop a couple times a week.


00:43:39.217 --> 00:43:43.559
Tell stories to the guys." And he
goes, "No, I don't take handouts."


00:43:48.727 --> 00:43:51.228
Are you a religious man?


00:43:51.229 --> 00:43:52.830
Why do you ask?


00:43:52.831 --> 00:43:57.173
Oh, just to see if you reside in
that papas camp of blind obedience.


00:44:00.071 --> 00:44:04.074
Well, no, no, I'm not
especially religious.


00:44:04.075 --> 00:44:06.010
But they call you Brother Albright.


00:44:06.011 --> 00:44:08.145
Ah, yeah, well...


00:44:08.146 --> 00:44:11.215
That's down at the harbor,
it's more of a term of affection.


00:44:11.216 --> 00:44:14.685
You know? "Hey, brother, hey,
bro." You know, that's all.


00:44:14.686 --> 00:44:16.263
What do you do down there?


00:44:16.988 --> 00:44:21.291
We're just a group of
people that do service.


00:44:21.292 --> 00:44:22.593
Service?


00:44:22.594 --> 00:44:25.468
Service, you know,
helping others in need.


00:44:26.731 --> 00:44:29.207
- Well, that's much better than religion.
- Yes.


00:44:33.104 --> 00:44:36.478
Ahem. You know that,
um... Yeah, thanks.


00:44:36.808 --> 00:44:39.343
...Sailor has another
fight lined up.


00:44:39.344 --> 00:44:40.711
I know.


00:44:40.712 --> 00:44:43.447
And he wants me to
be in the corner.


00:44:43.448 --> 00:44:45.149
He said you couldn't do it.


00:44:45.150 --> 00:44:48.285
Probably more correct is
you don't want to do it.


00:44:48.286 --> 00:44:49.486
That would be correct.


00:44:49.487 --> 00:44:51.922
- You don't want him to fight, do you?
- No, no, no.


00:44:51.923 --> 00:44:54.858
- And I don't suppose you do either.
- No, certainly not.


00:44:54.859 --> 00:44:58.165
God only knows why his
brains aren't scrambled.


00:44:59.964 --> 00:45:02.838
Look, um, Rose, I, uh...


00:45:03.768 --> 00:45:08.505
I hope I'm not talking out of turn
here, but Max told me that the reason


00:45:08.506 --> 00:45:11.475
he's taking the fight is because
he wants to take you to Ireland.


00:45:11.476 --> 00:45:15.488
No need to be delicate. He wants
to take me to Ireland before I die.


00:45:16.147 --> 00:45:17.915
I got it, but...


00:45:17.916 --> 00:45:20.984
see, the thing is that
Max and I could easily,


00:45:20.985 --> 00:45:22.453
easily cover that trip.


00:45:22.454 --> 00:45:25.828
No. Sailor would never
go for it, nor would I.


00:45:26.458 --> 00:45:31.368
But I would appreciate it if you and
Max would be in my boy's corner.


00:45:32.831 --> 00:45:34.476
You gonna be at the fight?


00:45:34.532 --> 00:45:37.542
No. I've never seen one of
Sailor's fights. Never will.


00:45:38.837 --> 00:45:43.440
Sixty-four fights. This
will be his 64th fight.


00:45:43.441 --> 00:45:45.642
My boy has a terrible
record, doesn't he?


00:45:45.643 --> 00:45:47.379
Yes, ma'am, he does. Ha, ha.


00:45:47.645 --> 00:45:50.881
But the man has never been down.
Never.


00:45:50.882 --> 00:45:53.183
But you see, a man should
know when to go down.


00:45:53.184 --> 00:45:55.986
A man should know when to quit.


00:45:55.987 --> 00:45:59.725
Yes, you think he
should. But, your boy...


00:46:01.025 --> 00:46:05.139
I mean, the guy is, um... I just
never seen anything like it.


00:46:05.697 --> 00:46:08.899
I mean, I thought I
was tough, but I'm...


00:46:08.900 --> 00:46:11.101
I'm like Tinker Bell or
something. I mean...


00:46:11.102 --> 00:46:14.538
I mean, I see him
get hit with, uh...


00:46:14.539 --> 00:46:16.874
With hammers, with...
I mean, and...


00:46:16.875 --> 00:46:19.777
It would kill an elephant.
He just will not go down.


00:46:19.778 --> 00:46:22.584
I just don't believe
it and I don't get it.


00:46:24.282 --> 00:46:26.291
Yeah, well...


00:46:28.887 --> 00:46:34.691
When he was a little boy, about 10,


00:46:34.692 --> 00:46:37.227
we were driving in the car.


00:46:37.228 --> 00:46:40.430
<i>His father had been drinking.</i>


00:46:40.431 --> 00:46:43.066
<i>He started hitting me hard.</i>


00:46:43.067 --> 00:46:44.468
Keep my mouth shut?


00:46:44.469 --> 00:46:45.636
Yes, your mouth shut.


00:46:45.637 --> 00:46:47.004
- Our boy's in the back...
- Unh!


00:46:47.005 --> 00:46:48.539
- Dad!
- You think I don't know


00:46:48.540 --> 00:46:50.073
the kid's in the backseat?


00:46:50.074 --> 00:46:52.376
You... You need help.


00:46:52.377 --> 00:46:55.524
You know what I need?
For you to shut up!


00:46:55.747 --> 00:46:57.426
Dad!


00:46:58.249 --> 00:46:59.983
- Get off!
- Sailor.


00:46:59.984 --> 00:47:01.418
Get off!


00:47:01.419 --> 00:47:04.225
<i>His father slammed his head
against the side window</i>


00:47:04.489 --> 00:47:07.329
so hard, it cracked the glass.


00:47:09.127 --> 00:47:11.102
Sailor passed out.


00:47:12.764 --> 00:47:15.566
George hit me some more


00:47:15.567 --> 00:47:18.509
and then he threw us
both out of the car.


00:47:20.939 --> 00:47:24.985
When Sailor came to, we were
at the side of the road.


00:47:25.210 --> 00:47:26.677
It wasn't your fault.


00:47:26.678 --> 00:47:28.412
<i>My face was a mess.</i>


00:47:28.413 --> 00:47:30.247
Are you okay?


00:47:30.248 --> 00:47:34.555
<i>He said he was okay,
but he really wasn't.</i>


00:47:35.787 --> 00:47:38.255
He knocked you out, Sailor.


00:47:38.256 --> 00:47:42.593
<i>Sailor vowed it would
never happen again.</i>


00:47:42.594 --> 00:47:45.775
<i>Maybe that's it. I don't know.</i>


00:47:50.201 --> 00:47:55.077
Or maybe he's just got a stupid
Irish head made of pig iron.


00:47:55.974 --> 00:47:58.780
But my boy's got sand.
That's for sure.


00:47:59.844 --> 00:48:02.081
Yes, he does.


00:48:03.314 --> 00:48:04.959
Um, what happened to your husband?


00:48:05.183 --> 00:48:08.819
I don't know. He left the day it
happened. I never saw him again.


00:48:08.820 --> 00:48:10.254
Never heard from him.


00:48:10.255 --> 00:48:13.527
- Sorry.
- Oh. There's no need to be.


00:48:13.825 --> 00:48:17.336
Please just be in my boy's corner.


00:48:20.398 --> 00:48:24.434
Yes, ma'am. Max and I will be.


00:48:24.435 --> 00:48:27.170
And you tell him when
it's time, you got that?


00:48:27.171 --> 00:48:29.282
You tell him when it's time.


00:48:29.841 --> 00:48:35.684
Because... Well, Sailor
just doesn't know.


00:48:36.414 --> 00:48:38.715
- I'm fine!
- King, let's have a look at that.


00:48:38.716 --> 00:48:40.554
I'm fine! You check him!


00:48:42.854 --> 00:48:45.125
Okay, that's clock.


00:48:46.858 --> 00:48:48.093
Aw...


00:48:48.760 --> 00:48:51.201
Come on, you're standing
like an ape. Come on!


00:48:56.267 --> 00:48:59.471
- Quick on your feet, Sailor!
- Double up the left hand, baby.


00:48:59.971 --> 00:49:02.048
Come on, boy! Hurry up now!


00:49:02.373 --> 00:49:04.018
Double that up, baby.


00:49:12.617 --> 00:49:14.718
That's it. Now, watch out for that.


00:49:14.719 --> 00:49:16.353
Break it up! Break it up!


00:49:16.354 --> 00:49:18.192
Come on, Sailor!


00:49:23.461 --> 00:49:24.761
Come on, King!


00:49:24.762 --> 00:49:26.897
You're getting schooled, Sailor!


00:49:26.898 --> 00:49:29.442
Break it up. Come on, break it up!


00:50:05.269 --> 00:50:06.846
Grab him.


00:50:09.107 --> 00:50:11.150
Come on. Knock him out!


00:50:11.509 --> 00:50:12.909
Let's go home, boy.


00:50:12.910 --> 00:50:15.556
- Break it up, guys.
- Hit him again.


00:50:19.917 --> 00:50:22.723
You got him, King! Take him down!


00:50:29.527 --> 00:50:32.333
Hey, come on, guys. Back
to your corners. Let's go!


00:50:34.766 --> 00:50:36.274
Get going!


00:50:37.969 --> 00:50:40.775
Put him out of his misery!
Come on, King!


00:50:42.540 --> 00:50:45.108
Sit the fuck down. Stop, come here.


00:50:45.109 --> 00:50:47.110
Come on, Sailor! Get the kid!


00:50:47.111 --> 00:50:48.915
Let me have a look at you here.


00:50:50.048 --> 00:50:52.049
You're letting that
old man beat you!


00:50:52.050 --> 00:50:55.288
- Get me a mirror.
- You don't need no mirror. Not now.


00:50:58.489 --> 00:51:02.865
- Send him to his grave!
- Put him in the hospital, King!


00:51:09.133 --> 00:51:10.634
- Hey.
- Hi.


00:51:10.635 --> 00:51:12.135
Are you okay?


00:51:12.136 --> 00:51:15.545
- I couldn't...
- It's okay, I'm a doctor.


00:51:20.011 --> 00:51:21.713
How far?


00:51:24.048 --> 00:51:25.283
Fourth month.


00:51:25.483 --> 00:51:27.350
Okay. We should get
you out of here.


00:51:27.351 --> 00:51:30.720
We need to get you in an ambulance.
Come on. Come with me.


00:51:30.721 --> 00:51:32.025
It's okay. Come on.


00:51:36.127 --> 00:51:39.740
Hey. That old man is messing
you up pretty good.


00:51:40.665 --> 00:51:42.902
You gonna let him
get away with that?


00:51:44.502 --> 00:51:48.672
What you smiling about?
You got nothing to smile about.


00:51:48.673 --> 00:51:50.375
I never liked being pretty.


00:51:51.042 --> 00:51:52.585
You ain't pretty no more.


00:51:53.211 --> 00:51:55.278
Best not to take any chances.


00:51:55.279 --> 00:51:57.647
King Soloman's my baby's daddy.


00:51:57.648 --> 00:52:00.484
- The young guy fighting?
- Yeah.


00:52:00.485 --> 00:52:02.219
We just got married.


00:52:02.220 --> 00:52:05.655
I don't have a ring yet, but he
says he's gonna get me a nice one


00:52:05.656 --> 00:52:08.124
- after he wins the fight.
- Oh, that's good. That's good.


00:52:09.627 --> 00:52:11.094
Why are you here?


00:52:11.095 --> 00:52:13.630
Sailor O'Connor, the guy
your husband's fighting.


00:52:13.631 --> 00:52:16.466
- The old guy.
- Yeah. What's your name?


00:52:16.467 --> 00:52:19.169
- Peg.
- Peg, I'm Diane.


00:52:19.170 --> 00:52:23.113
Mm. You got kids with Sailor?


00:52:23.741 --> 00:52:27.548
They are going crazy
with the presents.


00:52:27.912 --> 00:52:31.525
<i>No. Not with Sailor.</i>


00:52:39.524 --> 00:52:42.392
- Are you the lady that phoned 911?
- Yes.


00:52:42.393 --> 00:52:44.594
- What's the problem?
- Preterm contractions.


00:52:44.595 --> 00:52:47.531
She's in her second trimester.
Do you have a heart monitor?


00:52:47.532 --> 00:52:50.367
- Are you a doctor? Okay.
- Yes.


00:52:50.368 --> 00:52:53.203
You don't need to do this, okay?
There's no need to go on.


00:52:53.204 --> 00:52:56.248
We can end this with dignity.
You understand? With dignity.


00:52:57.108 --> 00:52:58.308
Look.


00:52:58.309 --> 00:53:02.012
<i>Come on, Sailor, come on!
Fight back! Come on! Fight back,</i>


00:53:02.013 --> 00:53:04.147
you little wuss. Come on!


00:53:04.148 --> 00:53:06.487
Come on, come on! Fight back!


00:53:06.918 --> 00:53:08.722
Get up, Sailor.


00:53:09.220 --> 00:53:12.455
Get up, you little wuss, get up!


00:53:12.456 --> 00:53:14.057
Get up.


00:53:14.058 --> 00:53:16.259
Get up!


00:53:16.260 --> 00:53:17.962
Get up!


00:53:19.463 --> 00:53:22.065
You don't need to do this.
There's no need to go on.


00:53:22.066 --> 00:53:25.468
You done yourself real good. You should
be proud. You made me damn proud.


00:53:25.469 --> 00:53:27.037
You're doing great.


00:53:27.038 --> 00:53:29.172
There's no shame in
throwing in the towel.


00:53:29.173 --> 00:53:32.075
You still got the record.
You still haven't gone down.


00:53:32.076 --> 00:53:35.314
- We can... I don't wanna do this.
- We can do this, Mike.


00:53:36.247 --> 00:53:38.815
What for? You still got...
You haven't gone down yet.


00:53:38.816 --> 00:53:40.917
- I ain't going down, Mike.
- Well, if you go down,


00:53:40.918 --> 00:53:42.586
you might not get up, okay?


00:53:42.587 --> 00:53:44.921
And if you go down,
I think I'll kick your ass.


00:53:44.922 --> 00:53:46.389
- All right.
- All right.


00:53:46.390 --> 00:53:47.724
I love you, Mike.


00:53:47.725 --> 00:53:50.594
- I'm telling you, the last one...
- Mike. I love you, Mike.


00:53:50.595 --> 00:53:52.035
I love you too.


00:53:58.102 --> 00:53:59.342
Okay, tough guy.


00:54:07.745 --> 00:54:11.392
Normal sinus rhythm,
hemodynamically stable.


00:54:12.516 --> 00:54:15.652
Peg, if this were me,


00:54:15.653 --> 00:54:19.489
I would go to the hospital just
for some extra testing, okay?


00:54:19.490 --> 00:54:22.933
I'm okay. Really, I'm...


00:54:25.997 --> 00:54:28.837
I gotta see the end of the fight.


00:54:30.134 --> 00:54:32.712
I must say, Rose,


00:54:32.970 --> 00:54:34.871
I'm a tad uncomfortable.


00:54:34.872 --> 00:54:39.643
What? Sitting in the home of a
woman who despises your God?


00:54:39.644 --> 00:54:41.380
I have a crucifix up my arse.


00:54:42.546 --> 00:54:46.455
Those were the conditions under
which you agreed to meet me, hm?


00:54:46.617 --> 00:54:48.551
You know, a man in your profession


00:54:48.552 --> 00:54:51.756
shouldn't joke about having
something up your butt.


00:54:52.823 --> 00:54:54.858
Sorry. Quite right.


00:54:54.859 --> 00:54:56.697
Do you know the old limerick?


00:54:57.395 --> 00:54:59.729
Which limerick would that be?


00:54:59.730 --> 00:55:03.500
<i>The altar boy, the altar boy
The dirty little beast</i>


00:55:03.501 --> 00:55:07.205
<i>He filled his ass with broken glass
And circumcised the priest</i>


00:55:09.774 --> 00:55:14.411
That's a sad commentary on what's
befallen the most noble calling.


00:55:14.412 --> 00:55:16.012
How do you handle such things?


00:55:16.013 --> 00:55:17.480
Such things?


00:55:17.481 --> 00:55:21.384
Well, the spirit is willing,
but the flesh is weak.


00:55:21.385 --> 00:55:25.855
You know, a priest once told me, he
tied his hands up with his rosary


00:55:25.856 --> 00:55:28.091
every night before he went to bed


00:55:28.092 --> 00:55:30.397
so he couldn't masturbate
while sleeping.


00:55:31.429 --> 00:55:34.109
And why did he tell you that?


00:55:34.965 --> 00:55:36.700
I was a young girl at the time.


00:55:36.701 --> 00:55:41.071
- I cut a bit of a skirt, I did in my day.
- No doubt.


00:55:41.072 --> 00:55:44.107
I think he wanted to get
up under that skirt.


00:55:44.108 --> 00:55:47.544
Just wanted to talk sexy
and try and get me going.


00:55:47.545 --> 00:55:49.088
Ah.


00:55:50.881 --> 00:55:56.186
Tell me, you're a relatively
young, seemingly virile man,


00:55:56.187 --> 00:55:59.889
who I'm assuming has all
parts yet fully functioning.


00:55:59.890 --> 00:56:01.758
Yes, as far as I know.


00:56:01.759 --> 00:56:03.526
Oh, mores the pity, then.


00:56:03.527 --> 00:56:06.162
Rose, I'm just a little
embarrassed here.


00:56:06.163 --> 00:56:08.934
- I'm not here to talk about my sex life.
- Ha.


00:56:08.966 --> 00:56:11.578
Well, here's hoping there's
something to talk about.


00:56:12.903 --> 00:56:14.480
Rose,


00:56:14.839 --> 00:56:16.039
um, Sailor's


00:56:16.040 --> 00:56:17.685
quite concerned about you.


00:56:18.275 --> 00:56:20.844
Sailor should be
concerned about himself.


00:56:20.845 --> 00:56:23.113
You know what he's gone
and done, don't you?


00:56:23.114 --> 00:56:25.048
You're talking about the fight.


00:56:25.049 --> 00:56:27.384
- Is that what you're calling it?
- What are you calling it?


00:56:27.385 --> 00:56:30.520
- My son is an old man.
- No, he's not that old.


00:56:30.521 --> 00:56:33.957
- He's...
- No. He's old and you know it.


00:56:33.958 --> 00:56:35.525
This won't be a fight.


00:56:35.526 --> 00:56:38.828
Sure, it will be. He's very
tough, he's in terrific shape.


00:56:38.829 --> 00:56:40.764
You know why he's
taking it, don't you?


00:56:40.765 --> 00:56:46.313
Yes. He wants to take you to
Ireland. One more visit for you.


00:56:47.338 --> 00:56:51.816
That's not it. He may think
that's it, but it's not.


00:56:52.443 --> 00:56:54.122
What do you think the reason is?


00:56:54.945 --> 00:56:56.556
Guilt.


00:56:58.783 --> 00:57:00.326
Guilt?


00:57:01.118 --> 00:57:02.490
About...?


00:57:03.154 --> 00:57:05.391
Being alive.


00:57:24.875 --> 00:57:26.782
Come on, King!


00:57:29.647 --> 00:57:31.793
Finish him off, King!


00:57:33.684 --> 00:57:35.488
Rock the body!


00:57:38.989 --> 00:57:40.356
You can do it!


00:57:40.357 --> 00:57:43.197
Take the old man out, King!


00:57:51.902 --> 00:57:54.082
Break it up, guys.
Break it up. Let's go.


00:57:55.806 --> 00:57:59.351
- Send him to his grave!
- Put him in the hospital, King!


00:58:05.649 --> 00:58:07.294
<i>How much?</i>


00:58:08.586 --> 00:58:13.929
How much wrong can a
person do before...?


00:58:15.826 --> 00:58:20.338
Before they've used up
whatever good is inside them?


00:58:25.769 --> 00:58:27.812
I mean...


00:58:29.406 --> 00:58:31.279
What I did...


00:58:36.413 --> 00:58:38.058
Diane...


00:58:39.016 --> 00:58:40.251
God...


00:58:41.385 --> 00:58:43.720
can be far worse than us.


00:58:43.721 --> 00:58:49.166
He can do more damage, cause
more pain and suffering,


00:58:49.460 --> 00:58:52.795
provide us with more temptation
than anything in the universe


00:58:52.796 --> 00:58:56.299
and yet, we sin,


00:58:56.300 --> 00:58:58.104
and he doesn't.


00:58:59.103 --> 00:59:01.749
I'm not quite sure how that works.


00:59:10.447 --> 00:59:12.718
I have nothing.


00:59:18.455 --> 00:59:21.033
How do I go on?


00:59:22.526 --> 00:59:25.400
You need to learn to surrender.


00:59:29.466 --> 00:59:32.078
You got him, King! Take him down!


00:59:37.441 --> 00:59:40.577
- Jab. Jab him!
- Break it up!


00:59:40.578 --> 00:59:42.312
Break it up, guys. Break it up.


00:59:42.313 --> 00:59:44.033
You got him, Sailor. He's tired!


00:59:44.281 --> 00:59:48.685
Sailor. Sailor, this boxing
is a younger man's sport,


00:59:48.686 --> 00:59:52.021
always has been, and you're not
as young as you used to be.


00:59:52.022 --> 00:59:54.190
Now, you're strong as a bull,


00:59:54.191 --> 00:59:55.592
but if you're taking this


00:59:55.593 --> 00:59:57.827
fight to make the money


00:59:57.828 --> 01:00:01.305
to take Rose to Ireland,
there are other ways.


01:00:01.632 --> 01:00:03.032
Bake sales.


01:00:03.033 --> 01:00:06.369
Yo, old-timer! Hey!


01:00:06.370 --> 01:00:08.550
You know who I am?


01:00:08.939 --> 01:00:12.875
I'm the man who's gonna
knock you the fuck out.


01:00:12.876 --> 01:00:14.919
That's who I am.


01:00:19.316 --> 01:00:22.292
Yeah. I know who you are.


01:00:24.355 --> 01:00:26.456
I hope you punish me.


01:00:26.457 --> 01:00:28.659
I hope you knock me
down, I really do.


01:00:29.193 --> 01:00:31.227
And I hope you


01:00:31.228 --> 01:00:33.601
knock some sense into this old man.


01:00:34.798 --> 01:00:36.204
That would be my wish.


01:00:39.336 --> 01:00:41.209
Let me ask you something.


01:00:41.972 --> 01:00:43.640
Do you have kids?


01:00:43.641 --> 01:00:46.219
- No, you're too young.
- I have one on the way.


01:00:47.778 --> 01:00:51.255
That's a beautiful thing.
It really is. Right, Sean?


01:00:51.548 --> 01:00:53.386
Yes, it is.


01:00:55.252 --> 01:00:56.522
You know,


01:00:57.721 --> 01:01:00.765
I held my son as he
took his final breath.


01:01:01.792 --> 01:01:04.598
I didn't have an answer for him.


01:01:07.564 --> 01:01:12.235
I will do my best, as will you.
Now, get the fuck out of here.


01:01:23.113 --> 01:01:25.088
No, stop!


01:01:41.065 --> 01:01:43.006
You okay?


01:01:50.274 --> 01:01:51.851
How long?


01:02:00.451 --> 01:02:02.426
Five years,


01:02:03.954 --> 01:02:05.497
11 months,


01:02:09.526 --> 01:02:11.933
27 days.


01:02:18.702 --> 01:02:20.381
So...


01:02:21.872 --> 01:02:23.983
how did you come to this?


01:02:24.875 --> 01:02:26.850
Bad relationship?


01:02:29.313 --> 01:02:33.188
Did anyone tell you about the
three rings of a relationship?


01:02:34.118 --> 01:02:39.358
Engagement ring, a wedding
ring and the suffering.


01:02:41.658 --> 01:02:43.337
Sorry.


01:02:44.228 --> 01:02:46.408
Bad joke.


01:02:57.908 --> 01:03:00.281
It's what I did.


01:03:03.847 --> 01:03:05.492
What you did?


01:03:12.356 --> 01:03:16.333
What we do is never really done.


01:03:20.798 --> 01:03:23.376
What you got in that glass,


01:03:23.801 --> 01:03:25.810
it won't help.


01:03:26.603 --> 01:03:28.441
It's not the answer.


01:03:29.373 --> 01:03:31.450
You know that.


01:03:33.777 --> 01:03:36.082
Because we all been there.


01:03:57.935 --> 01:03:59.876
Thank you.


01:04:39.409 --> 01:04:41.145
I, uh...


01:04:42.446 --> 01:04:44.148
I need to talk to you.


01:04:52.389 --> 01:04:54.364
Talk to him.


01:04:59.129 --> 01:05:01.097
Sailor, I...


01:05:01.098 --> 01:05:03.710
- I came here because...
- Diane.


01:05:05.035 --> 01:05:07.181
You were deceitful...


01:05:08.705 --> 01:05:12.011
without the slightest
consideration.


01:05:13.877 --> 01:05:15.750
A mother.


01:05:16.713 --> 01:05:18.290
A monster.


01:05:22.286 --> 01:05:27.367
I'm sorry. I am so, so sorry.


01:05:36.300 --> 01:05:38.480
You knew you were sick.


01:05:39.736 --> 01:05:42.041
Why didn't you seek help?


01:05:46.109 --> 01:05:50.086
Help was around you every day.


01:05:50.948 --> 01:05:52.525
Why?


01:05:53.383 --> 01:05:55.585
Why didn't you seek help?


01:06:07.431 --> 01:06:11.909
And now that you're better,
you want my forgiveness.


01:06:14.771 --> 01:06:16.416
No.


01:06:17.374 --> 01:06:19.781
Diane, Diane.


01:06:20.310 --> 01:06:24.754
Please, get out of here.


01:07:02.052 --> 01:07:08.259
I will spend the rest of my life
trying to make up for what I did,


01:07:09.860 --> 01:07:12.006
for the pain I caused you.


01:07:13.463 --> 01:07:15.768
Caused my family.


01:07:17.501 --> 01:07:20.079
I see the hate in your eyes.


01:07:21.104 --> 01:07:23.215
I deserve it.


01:07:24.207 --> 01:07:28.044
You don't. With each
breath I take, I...


01:07:28.045 --> 01:07:30.657
I hate myself enough
for the both of us.


01:07:37.654 --> 01:07:39.299
I'm not...


01:07:40.357 --> 01:07:43.299
I'm not asking for forgiveness.


01:07:44.261 --> 01:07:48.671
Contrary to the teachings
of your faith, there...


01:07:50.667 --> 01:07:54.212
There are things that
are unforgivable.


01:07:58.041 --> 01:08:01.654
But I will not have
you consumed by hate.


01:08:03.346 --> 01:08:07.383
So you... You pray to your God


01:08:07.384 --> 01:08:12.533
for your loss, for your salvation,


01:08:13.190 --> 01:08:15.131
and for theirs.


01:08:17.260 --> 01:08:21.567
You ask him to help you find
a way out of your hate.


01:08:25.469 --> 01:08:29.674
But don't you ever pray for me.


01:08:32.242 --> 01:08:34.547
I don't deserve it.


01:08:48.692 --> 01:08:52.669
Come on, son. You're gonna be late.


01:08:55.031 --> 01:08:59.034
- Use your jab. Use your jab.
- Break that glass jaw, Sailor.


01:08:59.035 --> 01:09:01.715
Take the old man out, King!


01:09:03.039 --> 01:09:04.240
Kill him, Sailor!


01:09:04.241 --> 01:09:06.114
Don't box if you can't
win a boxing match!


01:09:17.754 --> 01:09:21.123
Pauly. Come on.
We're gonna be late.


01:09:21.124 --> 01:09:23.065
What you got there?


01:09:23.527 --> 01:09:25.861
How about some ice
cream after church?


01:09:25.862 --> 01:09:28.063
Rinse that mug. Rinse it good.


01:09:28.064 --> 01:09:31.268
Sailor, look at me. You okay?


01:09:35.105 --> 01:09:37.615
All right, ladies and gentlemen!


01:09:40.343 --> 01:09:43.046
How are you enjoying
the fight tonight?


01:09:45.549 --> 01:09:49.629
Well, I think these boys have
suffered enough, don't you?


01:09:54.057 --> 01:09:57.893
So, what I'm gonna do is I'm
gonna offer them a new prize.


01:09:57.894 --> 01:10:01.030
- Twelve grand to the loser.
- Boo!


01:10:01.031 --> 01:10:04.166
Two grand more than
the winner's purse.


01:10:04.167 --> 01:10:06.108
What do you say?


01:10:07.037 --> 01:10:08.971
What do you say, Sailor?


01:10:08.972 --> 01:10:10.706
Hey, get him out of the ring!


01:10:10.707 --> 01:10:12.541
Get that piece of
shit out of there!


01:10:12.542 --> 01:10:15.245
That's the biggest
purse of your life.


01:10:15.845 --> 01:10:19.114
All you gotta do is lie down,
and the money's yours.


01:10:19.115 --> 01:10:21.050
Get out of the ring.
Get out of here.


01:10:21.051 --> 01:10:23.619
Sit down, sit down, sit down.
What's wrong with you?


01:10:23.620 --> 01:10:24.787
No! Oh,


01:10:24.788 --> 01:10:26.865
my gosh!


01:10:30.026 --> 01:10:32.467
What about you, King?


01:10:33.029 --> 01:10:35.835
I hear you got a baby coming soon.


01:10:36.466 --> 01:10:39.340
All you gotta do is just lie down.


01:10:40.837 --> 01:10:42.175
Yeah.


01:10:42.505 --> 01:10:45.241
Now I know you are a loser.


01:10:45.242 --> 01:10:48.577
- Twelve thousand dollars to the loser.
- Hey, hey.


01:10:48.578 --> 01:10:51.315
Don't do this, Eddie.
Don't do this.


01:10:51.448 --> 01:10:55.417
Do not do this. Yeah, you wanna
mess up the kid's career, huh?


01:10:55.418 --> 01:10:58.120
You're jealous because
you lost the purse.


01:10:58.121 --> 01:11:00.022
You lost him. You'll
never get him back.


01:11:00.023 --> 01:11:03.292
- Twelve thousand to your loser!
- Get him out of here!


01:11:03.293 --> 01:11:06.372
Get him out of my face!
You're a piece of shit!


01:11:08.398 --> 01:11:11.033
I'm done with you all!
I'm out of here.


01:11:11.034 --> 01:11:12.838
Let's pray.


01:11:13.470 --> 01:11:17.439
Father in heaven, please protect
Brother Sailor tonight.


01:11:17.440 --> 01:11:18.641
- Amen.
- Amen.


01:11:18.642 --> 01:11:22.911
Amen. And protect Brother
King tonight, as well.


01:11:22.912 --> 01:11:24.147
- Amen.
- Amen.


01:11:36.393 --> 01:11:38.231
Hold on for a second.


01:11:44.934 --> 01:11:46.511
Hey.


01:11:49.506 --> 01:11:51.845
Everything's gonna be okay.


01:11:53.276 --> 01:11:55.285
We're a family.


01:12:16.766 --> 01:12:19.268
You go, baby boy.


01:12:19.269 --> 01:12:21.471
You got this fight. You've won it.


01:12:22.138 --> 01:12:25.341
You've won the fight, man.
Don't do anything stupid.


01:12:25.342 --> 01:12:27.613
Gotta knock him down.


01:12:28.378 --> 01:12:31.559
All right. If you want
to knock him down,


01:12:32.182 --> 01:12:34.083
you work on his body.


01:12:34.084 --> 01:12:37.386
God knows what his head is made
of, but it sure ain't skin and bone.


01:12:37.387 --> 01:12:38.587
Gotta knock him down.


01:12:38.588 --> 01:12:41.357
You kill the body
and the head dies.


01:12:41.358 --> 01:12:44.732
You hear me? Kill the body
and the head will die.


01:12:45.061 --> 01:12:47.138
All right.


01:12:50.100 --> 01:12:51.301
- You all right?
- Yeah.


01:13:05.382 --> 01:13:07.152
It's time, kid.


01:13:11.488 --> 01:13:13.031
Hey, hey.


01:13:13.490 --> 01:13:16.671
I want you to know that I'm proud
of what you've become, boy.


01:13:18.862 --> 01:13:20.769
Okay, let's go, guys.


01:13:21.731 --> 01:13:23.410
Sailor.


01:13:24.234 --> 01:13:26.880
That's enough, bud. That's
enough, that's enough.


01:13:36.880 --> 01:13:39.321
You're getting schooled, Sailor!


01:13:44.754 --> 01:13:47.833
Get outside that left foot!
Outside the left foot!


01:13:48.191 --> 01:13:50.166
Put him in the hospital, King!


01:13:52.762 --> 01:13:53.997
Put him down!


01:13:56.499 --> 01:13:59.578
Break it up, guys. Come on.


01:14:40.910 --> 01:14:43.420
- Hey!
- Sailor, I'm sorry.


01:14:44.113 --> 01:14:46.850
- I'm sorry.
- Back to your corner, let's go.


01:14:53.256 --> 01:14:54.690
Hey, you okay?


01:14:54.691 --> 01:14:55.958
I shat myself.


01:14:55.959 --> 01:14:58.264
All right, Sailor,
stay standing. I got it.


01:14:58.962 --> 01:15:01.108
Hey, hey, clean towels, now.


01:15:02.332 --> 01:15:04.478
Hey, look. He lost his mud.


01:15:04.734 --> 01:15:06.607
The Sailor lost his mud, man.


01:15:07.136 --> 01:15:08.604
The Sailor's gonna go down.


01:15:08.605 --> 01:15:11.473
For the first time in history,
that Sailor's gonna go down.


01:15:11.474 --> 01:15:14.343
Now is your shot, man.
Now is your shot.


01:15:14.344 --> 01:15:17.112
You go get him. Get on him.


01:15:17.113 --> 01:15:20.317
- This is your shot. For life.
- Shut up!


01:15:26.322 --> 01:15:28.891
You're doing good, buddy.
It's all over, okay?


01:15:28.892 --> 01:15:30.359
- One more.
- It's all over.


01:15:30.360 --> 01:15:32.427
- One more round.
- Your kidneys are gone.


01:15:32.428 --> 01:15:35.998
What is the matter with you? What
are you, nuts? What's the point?


01:15:35.999 --> 01:15:38.634
You couldn't beat this guy
with a baseball bat, okay?


01:15:38.635 --> 01:15:40.969
You got another L in
the column. Big deal.


01:15:40.970 --> 01:15:44.439
You're still standing, right? You
never been down. What is the point?


01:15:44.440 --> 01:15:47.780
I swore on my ma's head I
would never quit, Mikey.


01:15:48.678 --> 01:15:52.114
- I promised.
- You're good to go, Sailor.


01:15:52.115 --> 01:15:54.116
We'll let the doc decide. You sit.


01:15:54.117 --> 01:15:56.923
Hey, Gordy, you bring
the doc, please?


01:16:01.858 --> 01:16:03.058
Look at me.


01:16:03.059 --> 01:16:04.863
Sailor.


01:16:05.862 --> 01:16:10.670
- Sailor, look at me. You okay?
- I'm good, doc.


01:16:11.601 --> 01:16:14.002
You're taking too many
shots. I'm gonna stop it.


01:16:14.003 --> 01:16:16.638
One more round, doc,
please. One more round.


01:16:16.639 --> 01:16:19.115
Albright, what do you think?


01:16:19.809 --> 01:16:22.216
I got no opinion.


01:16:23.446 --> 01:16:25.785
Last round, doc,
last round, please.


01:16:26.616 --> 01:16:28.796
I hope I don't hate
myself later for this.


01:16:28.952 --> 01:16:32.190
- You won't.
- Ref, watch him close.


01:16:37.594 --> 01:16:39.595
- Knock him on his butt!
- Shut up!


01:16:39.596 --> 01:16:41.463
- You gonna be famous, man.
- Shut up!


01:16:41.464 --> 01:16:43.832
- What do you mean, shut up?
- Shut up!


01:16:43.833 --> 01:16:46.668
This is your turn, man.
I don't care what you say,


01:16:46.669 --> 01:16:50.783
you get your butt up there
and put the Sailor down!


01:16:51.708 --> 01:16:55.321
All right, Sailor. All right.


01:17:22.505 --> 01:17:23.843
I'm gonna be okay, Mike.


01:17:25.108 --> 01:17:27.015
I promise.


01:17:27.910 --> 01:17:31.182
I promise. I love you.


01:17:34.283 --> 01:17:36.585
Last round! Last round.


01:17:36.586 --> 01:17:38.020
- Come on.
- Come on, guys.


01:17:38.021 --> 01:17:40.929
- Seconds out.
- Let's go home!


01:17:44.761 --> 01:17:47.134
Get outside that left foot.


01:17:49.732 --> 01:17:51.700
Use your jab, use your jab!


01:17:51.701 --> 01:17:53.869
Last round, guys, let's go. Box!


01:17:53.870 --> 01:17:56.516
Come on, old man!


01:17:57.340 --> 01:17:59.741
One punch, Sailor!
Come on, bud, one punch!


01:17:59.742 --> 01:18:01.977
Quick on your feet, Sailor!


01:18:01.978 --> 01:18:05.318
Stay on his right shoulder!
Stay on his right shoulder!


01:18:06.916 --> 01:18:08.720
You're getting schooled, Sailor!


01:18:12.789 --> 01:18:14.423
Break it up.


01:18:14.424 --> 01:18:16.626
Break it up, boy! Break it up!


01:18:26.969 --> 01:18:29.945
- Double that up, baby.
- Get away from him.


01:19:17.053 --> 01:19:19.893
Sailor, grab him! Grab him!


01:19:32.034 --> 01:19:33.304
Give me the towel.


01:19:35.104 --> 01:19:37.648
Put him down! Put him down!


01:19:38.241 --> 01:19:40.443
Oh!


01:19:43.646 --> 01:19:45.553
Do it, kid. Do it.


01:19:48.851 --> 01:19:51.292
Oh!


01:20:00.163 --> 01:20:02.036
Okay, let's go.


01:20:09.272 --> 01:20:11.884
Take the old man out, King!


01:20:12.008 --> 01:20:13.619
Let him go, King.


01:20:15.344 --> 01:20:16.579
Let him go, man.


01:20:17.914 --> 01:20:20.185
Ref, leave him alone!
Leave him alone!


01:20:20.917 --> 01:20:23.752
- I got you.
- He's taking him to the bell.


01:20:23.753 --> 01:20:25.091
We got this.


01:20:25.788 --> 01:20:27.899
Let him go. Drop him.


01:20:47.944 --> 01:20:50.912
<i>Ladies and gentlemen!</i>


01:20:50.913 --> 01:20:53.719
<i>It's a unanimous decision.</i>


01:20:54.217 --> 01:20:57.728
The winner is King Soloman!


01:21:14.136 --> 01:21:16.179
I'm proud of you. Good fight.


01:21:18.241 --> 01:21:20.352
You're a good kid.


01:21:29.819 --> 01:21:32.621
You know what? You're the
toughest son of a bitch I know.


01:21:32.622 --> 01:21:33.822
Thank you.


01:21:33.823 --> 01:21:36.867
Yeah, you're also the dumbest
son of a bitch I know.


01:21:47.670 --> 01:21:49.144
Go see your girl.


01:21:57.747 --> 01:21:59.756
I love you.


01:22:42.058 --> 01:22:43.464
The...


01:22:49.665 --> 01:22:52.038
The best we can do...


01:22:58.074 --> 01:23:00.880
is to forgive ourselves.


01:23:07.049 --> 01:23:08.819
Diane.


01:23:11.520 --> 01:23:13.791
You're not alone.
